%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0fd4c3c83fae23b4cae61c12ce438472, type: 3}
  m_Name: Butcher
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Butcher
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - Being the new farmer involves more than watching grass.
    - It also involves getting your hands bloody.
    - Else your farm will be reduced to burrows and scraps.
    emotions: 030000000000000002000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: Again...?
    paragraphs:
    - Oh joy.... {itemName}.... Again....  {itemGiven}
    emotions: 03000000
  paths:
  - pathName: Buy something!
    paragraphs:
    - These could be of use to you.
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Want to buy this?
    paragraphs:
    - Ahh that {storeItemName}. It will cost you {storeItemValue} <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color>
      <sprite index=0>!
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Sold!
    paragraphs:
    - It is all yours. {itemBought}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: No Money
    paragraphs:
    - You got any more Mints</color> <sprite index=0>!
    emotions: 04000000
  - pathName: No Space
    paragraphs:
    - You can't carry this.
    emotions: 04000000
  - pathName: Have some Ammo
    paragraphs:
    - It is dangerous to be beyond the town walls without any ammunition. {freezePlayer}
    - Here, take some extra of mine.
    - Whatever it takes to make sure I still have some greens on my plate at the
      end of the day.
    emotions: 04000000
  fillerPaths:
  - pathName: Drying Rack
    paragraphs:
    - The meat of the animals here is not the same it was years ago.
    - More marbling, excess bones, and filled with what I am hesitant to call blood.
    - At least drying the flesh makes it... edible.
    emotions: 020000000000000000000000
  - pathName: Dont waste Ammo
    paragraphs:
    - Be mindful of how much you shoot that gun of yours, ya hear??
    - Ammo is not easy to come by. Use it for emergencies only.
    - Not to mention you keep waking me up at night with all your wanton shooting.
    emotions: 030000000600000003000000
  - pathName: Ammo Shortage
    paragraphs:
    - Trust me, if I could sell more ammo, I would.
    - We don't have the materials to make any. All my stock, comes from him.
    - Plus, with the way you aim, I would be making a fortune.
    emotions: 020000000000000001000000
  - pathName: Limited supplies
    paragraphs:
    - It's already bad enough our hunting supplies are limited.
    - Now the game we once hunted is hunting us.
    - There are even stories of the deers attacking folk.
    emotions: 000000000200000005000000
  - pathName: The wagon merchant
    paragraphs:
    - I remember the day the merchant rolled into town.
    - It was about a fortnight after the initial Mist began to envelop the community.
    - He was able to slip in admist the panic, and no one even batted an eye at his
      presence.
    - Never did trust him. But he is the only trade the town has, ever since imports
      stopped coming.
    emotions: 000000000200000005000000
  - pathName: Creatures are getting smarter
    paragraphs:
    - The beasts are getting smarter by the day.
    - Each dawn I go to see if any of my traps outside claimed any meat, and each
      day I go out to see the traps either empty of missing.
    - I fear the day they begin to use the traps againt US.
    emotions: 000000000000000002000000
  - pathName: I went to the wilderness
    paragraphs:
    - Once some time ago I convinced the figure at the wagon to escort me into the
      woods, where I used to catch game.
    - I deployed so many of my traps, thinking I would outsmart at least one critter.
    - But when I set out the next day, it was as if he took me to a completely different
      spot. I never did see my traps again.
    emotions: 000000000200000005000000
  questPaths: []
  itemRecievedPaths:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I don't have much use for something like that.
    - If you are looking to sell your stuff, I bet that weird wagon fellow will purchase
      it.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  itemSpecificRemarks:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - What do you take me for, a charity?
    - I have need to spend my precious <color=#E0D38F> Mints</color> <sprite index=0>
      on your junk.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  friendshipPath1: []
  friendshipPath2: []
  friendshipPath3: []
  alreadySpoken:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - '...

'
    emotions: 06000000
  branchingPaths: []
  questCompletePaths:
  - pathName: Default Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - Thank you for completing my quest!
    emotions: 01000000
